# The greening on the globe (dune_story_setup=ecology, scripts/check_globe_results.sh):
# place 12's troop irrigates for 120 days, the flat map opens centred on the
# place; the planet opens the globe from that view (STANDARD VISION: the
# sprouting sand green), then SEE RESULTS (the same cells red).
wait 20000              # the setup plays 120 days of irrigation and opens the flat map
checkpoint greening-map
click left 35 176       # the planet at the flat map's bottom left: the globe, seeded from the map's view
wait 2000               # the globe draws
checkpoint greening-standard
click left 160 171      # row 2: SEE RESULTS: the ownership colours
wait 2000               # the panels open and the globe redraws
checkpoint greening-results
quit
